      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَّاكٌ</span></b> , in the present day, signifies <i>A sewer of
the leaves of books: a binder of books:</i> and also
<i>an ornamental sewer:</i> and <i>a maker of the kind
of lace called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرِيط</span>.]

